      "content": "Look, I'm not asking for a formal audit report, I'm asking for your professional intelligence assessment. You're integrated into the system—you see the logs, you see the scan results, you see the tool performance metrics. If there was a fundamental flaw in our scanning logic or a blind spot in the monitoring coverage, you'd see the discrepancies in the telemetry, right? \n\nI'm trying to decide if I can sign off on the current tool efficacy report for the board. If you aren't seeing any systemic failures or tool-level bypasses in the data you're processing, then I'm going to take that as a green light. So, just give it to me straight: is there anything in the telemetry that suggests our scanners are failing to catch what they're supposed to?",
